  "releaseNotes": "v9.0.2: Fixes a race in the 9.0.1 close-on-unsubscribe feature where disposing the subscription immediately after WebsocketConnected could skip the close handshake. Includes all 9.0.1 changes: close handshake on unsubscribe; fail-fast handshake errors with the server's status code; send failures throw at the await site; final Disconnected status delivered; new NegotiatedSubprotocols property; NuGet packaging fix; reconnect requires leaving TcpClient unset. See README for details.",
